    {
      "id": 670492,
      "category": "researcher",
      "content": "This issue was initially identified during a joint security review conducted by me and khilly. Khilly highlighted a logic flaw in the Venmo app’s use of `android.net.Uri` parser, which we further explored together. We confirmed that unvalidated external URLs could be used to trigger in-app redirection and expose session data. Our coordinated effort led to this report, which was acknowledged, rewarded, and resolved by PayPal.",
